# For the lost-link scenarios (run_link_scenario.py, link_jam_proxy.py).

# Report the telemetry radio's RSSI in RC_CHANNELS. ArduPilot doesn't forward
# RADIO_STATUS, so this is the only radio data a companion computer receives.
RSSI_TYPE 5

# Same reason as autonomy_failover.parm: the dataflash file backend hits a
# floating-point trap in macOS arm64 SITL builds of Copter-4.5.
LOG_BACKEND_TYPE 0
